<title>MOZAMBIQUE: Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>MOZAMBIQUE, Aug 26 - Port conditions Beira, Aug 19 - Three vessels waiting to berth at general cargo berths. The rail service on the Beira corridor has been disrupted due to a derailment at km 270. The service is expected to reopen Aug 25.</p>
</text>
